# Per-user strategy book — your macro allocations + the derived trading universe. Kept
# private so a public repo never exposes your holdings. Copy strategy.yaml.example to
# start; on the box it's pulled from SSM (see DEPLOY.md). config.yaml carries NO secrets
# (those are in .env) and IS committed.
strategy.yaml

